      <description>&lt;pre&gt;PhotoFindry 0.2.0-beta.1 (build 74)

First public beta for Apple-silicon Macs. Local photo tagging, people and search;
portable saved work; explicit signed updates; optional coffee support in Getting Started.

Updates replace the application bundle and preserve saved library data, originals
and selected model paths. Keep independent backups before trying beta software.

Ad-hoc signed; not Apple Developer ID signed or notarized. macOS 14.0 minimum;
qualified on macOS 27.0. Main vision model and matching projector selected separately.
&lt;/pre&gt;</description>
